// Section 3 fixture: two once-only [choice-only] choices, no variables.
// Compiled to section3_choices.ink.json via the local inklecate build
// (claude_docs/tools/ink-reference). Uses only the plain bracket-text
// choice form ("* [choice-only] more text") — the "text[choice]more"
// start+choice-only combo compiles to weave/tunnel machinery ($r variable
// pointer redirection) that Section 3 deliberately doesn't implement (see
// the plan's Step 2 Section 3 entry).
Hello, traveler.

* [Go north] You went north.
* [Go south] You went south.

You made your choice.
-> END
